    "body": "## Summary\n- add explicit admin enforcement for confirmed job reports\n- support `CANCEL_OPEN_JOB` only for reports already marked `REVIEWED`\n- cancel only still-open listings so discovery stops surfacing them without touching active escrow or participant tracking\n- persist a one-per-report immutable audit record with report, job, moderator, action, reason and timestamp\n- add Flyway V26, service/controller validation, regression tests and trust/safety documentation\n\n## Safety / privacy\n- enforcement is separate from moderation review and never runs automatically\n- active jobs (`IN_PROGRESS` or later) are rejected to avoid mutating an assignment, tracking session or escrow through the report workflow\n- no new public data is exposed; enforcement records are admin-side audit data\n\n## Validation\nRun Maven verify, frontend lint/build, Flyway/PostgreSQL/runtime smoke and existing payment/runtime gates. Do not merge unless required checks are green.",
